        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Shaped by Musician Baiyon’s Vision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director Baiyon, originally a musician and later a multimedia artist, brings his unique vision of games and art to life through this title. This one-of-a-kind experience comes together as one unified experience of game, art, sound, and story. The concepts of  “No Creation Without Destruction” explored in the work reflect his personal interpretation of games and art. Memories and regrets, along with the subtle thoughts of everyday objects like chairs and streetlamps, intertwine to shape a story that is whimsical, peculiar, and delicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person exploration game built around the philosophical theme, “No Creation Without Destruction.” Rather than destroying objects by shooting, your shots materialize and create the world. Take your time in the world you create and discover mysterious characters and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All conversations with objects can be revisited in the Sentiments menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Bold Visual Approach with Point Cloud Rendering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using point cloud technology rarely seen in games, this game allows players to create and explore a dream world, resulting in a truly unique experience. Rather than imitating the visuals of typical 3D games, every moment evokes the feeling of a fleeting, dreamlike painting—captured and vanishing before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/4e61ac8f7ccd17bfe45f07e0cabc9b93.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/4e61ac8f7ccd17bfe45f07e0cabc9b93.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nonlinear, Player-Assembled Dream Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the space between dream and reality, and assemble a story from non-linear fragments of a puzzle. The moments of this world gradually reveal their meaning. Time here flows differently—abstract, unhurried, and distant from the busy pace of everyday life. Through the perspective of the Man in Pajamas and the thoughts that objects seem to whisper, discover a peculiar quiet, gentle humor, and reflections on yourself. We recommend playing in an environment where you can fully enjoy the sound to experience the dreamlike atmosphere personally crafted by Baiyon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/f56ba7e09236a9964b7dc291ab33bff6.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/f56ba7e09236a9964b7dc291ab33bff6.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Shaped by Musician Baiyon’s Vision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director Baiyon, originally a musician and later a multimedia artist, brings his unique vision of games and art to life through this title. This one-of-a-kind experience comes together as one unified experience of game, art, sound, and story. The concepts of  “No Creation Without Destruction” explored in the work reflect his personal interpretation of games and art. Memories and regrets, along with the subtle thoughts of everyday objects like chairs and streetlamps, intertwine to shape a story that is whimsical, peculiar, and delicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/c400c2c07e51f6466f5c2bd580ad66d5.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person exploration game built around the philosophical theme, “No Creation Without Destruction.” Rather than destroying objects by shooting, your shots materialize and create the world. Take your time in the world you create and discover mysterious characters and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/82c2793cf05c01f203e0ec001b106328.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/8393de850a5fa93ebb2bb6e0d59e7512.mp4?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All conversations with objects can be revisited in the Sentiments menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Bold Visual Approach with Point Cloud Rendering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using point cloud technology rarely seen in games, this game allows players to create and explore a dream world, resulting in a truly unique experience. Rather than imitating the visuals of typical 3D games, every moment evokes the feeling of a fleeting, dreamlike painting—captured and vanishing before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/4e61ac8f7ccd17bfe45f07e0cabc9b93.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/4e61ac8f7ccd17bfe45f07e0cabc9b93.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nonlinear, Player-Assembled Dream Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the space between dream and reality, and assemble a story from non-linear fragments of a puzzle. The moments of this world gradually reveal their meaning. Time here flows differently—abstract, unhurried, and distant from the busy pace of everyday life. Through the perspective of the Man in Pajamas and the thoughts that objects seem to whisper, discover a peculiar quiet, gentle humor, and reflections on yourself. We recommend playing in an environment where you can fully enjoy the sound to experience the dreamlike atmosphere personally crafted by Baiyon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/f56ba7e09236a9964b7dc291ab33bff6.poster.avif?t=1775094512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561230/extras/f56ba7e09236a9964b7dc291ab33bff6.webm?t=1775094512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
